12:38:16.235 > MANUAL CALIBRATION COMMANDS
12:38:16.235 > CAL X|Y|Z: begin manual endpoint calibration
12:38:16.240 > JX-1/JX1, JY-1/JY1, JZ-1/JZ1: hold-to-jog during calibration
12:38:16.244 > JX0/JY0/JZ0 or STOP: controlled stop
12:38:16.248 > CONFIRM / CANCEL: accept or reject the 2-second endpoint prompt
12:38:16.256 > PX10/PX25/PX50/PX75/PX90: move a calibrated axis
12:38:16.260 > HOME X|Y|Z: move to stored 0%, not physical auto-homing
12:38:16.264 > O or ESTOP: immediate latched stop; CLEAR only after ALM is normal
